ent-AdvancedCyberneticLiver = advanced cybernetic liver
    .desc = A robust synthetic liver that filters small doses of poison and neutralizes alcohol poisoning.
ent-BasicCyberneticStomach = basic cybernetic stomach
    .desc = A simple synthetic stomach that digests food more slowly than an organic stomach.
ent-UpgradedCyberneticStomach = upgraded cybernetic stomach
    .desc = A synthetic stomach that digests food faster than an organic stomach.
ent-AdvancedCyberneticStomach = advanced cybernetic stomach
    .desc = A robust synthetic stomach that digests food twice as fast as an organic stomach.
ent-AdvancedCyberneticHeart = advanced cybernetic heart
    .desc = A synthetic heart that rapidly replenishes lost blood, suppresses bleeding and briefly restores mobility in critical condition.
ent-GlowCyberneticEyes = high luminosity cybernetic eyes
    .desc = Synthetic eyes with lights that match the owner's eye colour.
ent-ActionToggleCyberneticEyes = Toggle eye lights
    .desc = Turn the lights in your cybernetic eyes on or off.
ent-BreathingTubeAugment = breathing tube augment
    .desc = An implanted internals connector that allows its owner to breathe from a tank without a mask.
ent-SurgeryOpenBreathingTubeCavity = Open cavity for breathing tube
ent-SurgeryInsertBreathingTube = Insert breathing tube
ent-SurgeryRemoveBreathingTube = Remove breathing tube
ent-AntiDropAugment = anti-drop implant
    .desc = A brain implant that contracts the hand muscles to hold onto carried items. Twitch your ear to relax your grip.
ent-CnsRebooterAugment = CNS rebooter implant
    .desc = A brain implant that automatically restores control of the central nervous system after a stun. It briefly resists further stuns and injury-induced sluggishness before recharging.
ent-ActionToggleAntiDrop = Toggle grip lock
    .desc = Contract or relax your hand muscles to retain or release the items you are holding.
anti-drop-tightened = Your grip tightens.
anti-drop-relaxed = Your hands relax.
anti-drop-empty = You are not holding anything. Your hands relax.
cns-rebooter-activated = Your CNS rebooter restores control of your body!
cns-rebooter-ready = Your CNS rebooter is ready.
ent-SurgeryOpenAntiDropCavity = Prepare cavity for anti-drop implant
ent-SurgeryInsertAntiDrop = Insert anti-drop implant
ent-SurgeryRemoveAntiDrop = Remove anti-drop implant
ent-SurgeryRemoveCnsRebooter = Remove CNS rebooter
ent-AutosurgeonCnsRebooter = syndicate autosurgeon (CNS rebooter)
    .desc = { ent-BaseAutosurgeonSyndicateSingle.desc }
ent-CyberThrustersAugment = implantable thrusters set
    .desc = An implantable set of thruster ports. They use the gas from the environment or the user's internals for propulsion in zero gravity. Unlike regular jetpacks, this device has no stabilization system.
ent-ActionToggleCyberThrusters = Toggle thrusters
    .desc = Turn your implanted thrusters on or off.
cyber-thrusters-on = You turn your thrusters set on.
cyber-thrusters-off = You turn your thrusters set off.
cyber-thrusters-no-propellant = Your thrusters have nothing to propel themselves with.
ent-SurgeryOpenCyberThrustersCavity = Prepare cavity for thrusters set
ent-SurgeryInsertCyberThrusters = Insert thrusters set
ent-SurgeryRemoveCyberThrusters = Remove thrusters set
ent-HerculeanSpineAugment = Herculean gravitronic spinal implant
    .desc = This gravitronic spinal interface improves the athletics of its user, letting them get up, climb and carry others faster and throw harder.
herculean-spine-emp = You feel shearing pain as your body is crushed like a soda can!
ent-SurgeryOpenHerculeanSpineCavity = Prepare cavity for Herculean spinal implant
ent-SurgeryInsertHerculeanSpine = Insert Herculean spinal implant
ent-SurgeryRemoveHerculeanSpine = Remove Herculean spinal implant
ent-ReviverAugment = reviver implant
    .desc = This implant will attempt to revive and heal you if you lose consciousness. For the faint of heart!
reviver-implant-started = You feel a faint buzzing as your reviver implant starts patching your wounds...
reviver-implant-recharging = Your reviver implant shuts down and starts recharging. It will be ready again in {$seconds} seconds.
reviver-implant-revived = {CAPITALIZE(THE($target))}'s body convulses a bit.
ent-SurgeryRemoveReviver = Remove reviver implant
ent-AutosurgeonReviver = syndicate autosurgeon (reviver)
    .desc = { ent-BaseAutosurgeonSyndicateSingle.desc }
ent-BaseStrongArmAugment = Strong-Arm empowered musculature implant
    .desc = When implanted, this cybernetic implant will enhance the muscles of the arm to deliver more power-per-action. Install one in each arm to pry open doors with your bare hands!
ent-StrongArmLeftAugment = { ent-BaseStrongArmAugment }
    .suffix = Left
    .desc = { ent-BaseStrongArmAugment.desc }
ent-StrongArmRightAugment = { ent-BaseStrongArmAugment }
    .suffix = Right
    .desc = { ent-BaseStrongArmAugment.desc }
ent-SurgeryOpenStrongArmLeftCavity = Prepare cavity for left Strong-Arm implant
ent-SurgeryInsertStrongArmLeft = Insert left Strong-Arm implant
ent-SurgeryRemoveStrongArmLeft = Remove left Strong-Arm implant
ent-SurgeryOpenStrongArmRightCavity = Prepare cavity for right Strong-Arm implant
ent-SurgeryInsertStrongArmRight = Insert right Strong-Arm implant
ent-SurgeryRemoveStrongArmRight = Remove right Strong-Arm implant
